        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;MVP guardrails&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• One L2-3 EC2 may host JobManager + TaskManager initially&lt;br&gt;• Keep the adapter queue and pending registry bounded&lt;br&gt;• Do not block Flink operator threads on SageMaker&lt;br&gt;• Data capture must not delay the response path" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#D39B26;dashed=1;fontColor=#4B5563;align=left;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1450" y="620" width="280" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

